flowchart TB
  R[Authenticated resident] --> W[Next.js + TypeScript interface]
  S[Authorized barangay staff] --> W
  W -->|REST over HTTPS / secure session| A[FastAPI modular monolith]
  A --> DB[(PostgreSQL: separate narratives, labels, decisions and cases)]
  A --> I[Saved TF-IDF + Linear SVM inference]
  M[Approved immutable model registry] --> I
  I --> P{Predicted text label}
  P -->|Valid| C[Policy-based Accepted disposition + Unresolved case]
  P -->|Suspicious or Spam| H[Administrator review]
  H -->|Accept| C
  H --> Q[Clarification or reasoned rejection]
  Q -->|Revised narrative| I
  C --> K[Assigned case processing and verified resolution]
  A --> U[Urgency flag and human safety lane independent of prediction]
  DB --> J[Worker: outbox, notices, overdue alerts and quality audits]
  H --> F[Quality-screened version-specific verified feedback]
  F --> T[Authorized offline training and evaluation]
  T --> G[Approval gate and rollback check]
  G --> M
